Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenth Episode\NThe Dangerous Doll\NSapphire's Carnival
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look Franz, look at the pathetic state you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I read too many mangas last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will soon enter the Kingdom of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together and act like a proper prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.39,0:02:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sapphire, Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he went out for a walk somewhere again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a troublesome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to him, Prince Franz is so splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome! We are honored by your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chanel V
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it has been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz has disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That is truly a most disgraceful matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To think they would disappear after our country invited them—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,King Chanel V is fuming as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Only after you've met King Chanel V...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell them I disappeared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, let me ride too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where they went?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a giant doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the automaton doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, it sure was a struggle to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought in a puppeteer from a distant land,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and kept it secret from the townspeople while installing a bow inside its mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut the nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it guaranteed to kill Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Spot on, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Sapphire sits properly in the prince's seat to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.11,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it from the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but inside its belly, water is boiling piping hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it moves using the power of that steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of it, Grand Duke Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a magnificent doll this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have a voice too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oho, it even has a voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that shouldn't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what pretty fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you sneak out of the castle too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The town is really fun with the carnival going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.81,0:08:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go play!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way more fun than staying inside the castle, isn't it, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stay shut up inside the castle—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go outside and play to our heart's content!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.04,0:08:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so much going on in town, it's really exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't just play around all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon and Duralumin are always up to no good,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have to keep an eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to play as much as you can while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you become king, you won't be able to do anything. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought it at a shop earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's perfect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.19,0:08:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a girl, after all—you should have at least one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make fun of me, Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw this one in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dress them up in whatever clothes we have on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.27,0:09:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is number one in the costume parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me set off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a beautiful girl with flaxen hair
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, shall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone gather in front of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the Great King's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Have you seen a girl with flaxen hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.89,0:13:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't seen her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.26,0:13:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She should be around here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you take care of that brat named Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've locked him inside that factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, when we defeat Sapphire, we'll finish him off together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What, defeat Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry and warn Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Franz and Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing those guys, they're probably making a racket somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.81,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Play a more interesting song!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So Sapphire was in a place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to those tricks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, something more lively would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'd prefer something more elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who called me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.74,0:14:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon and his gang are up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They say they're going to take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.93,0:14:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be surprised about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the usual thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But that kid named Tink is your friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure exactly where, but apparently he's locked up in a factory nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There sure are a lot of dolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.91,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he not in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it really shoot Sapphire successfully?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing has been left to chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When the doll's head catches on that wire, the mechanism inside will activate,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,shooting Sapphire straight through the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But Nylon, will Sapphire stay still until the doll passes by?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I have successfully tricked the Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, did you find that kid named Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't found.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched all night yesterday, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go look for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Your Highness, you promised to behave properly like a prince for the entire day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just shouldn't move from here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The doll is moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,By attaching a bow to the doll's mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can definitely kill Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.06,0:17:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.78,0:18:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.32,0:19:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That doll did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You cursed dangerous doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've come...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They said if you break the part where steam comes out, it'll stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, It’s going to hit the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.41,0:22:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.79,0:22:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.02,0:22:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Run fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,About the mirror... I'm safe because you treated me like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.16,0:23:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I won't say you're a girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, on the night of the festival, I met a wonderful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.32,0:23:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl with flaxen hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She was so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.27,0:23:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl with the flaxen hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find her! I'll find that young lady!
